<title>USA: Morrison Fresh president/COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Morrison Fresh president/COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Fresh Cooking Inc said Friday that Christopher Elliott, president and chief operating officer, has resigned from the company effective immediately. The company said Ronnie Tatum, chief executive officer, will assume his duties on a permanent basis and that no search for a replacement will be made.</p>
<p>The company did not provide a reason for Elliott's resignation, but said that it now intends to maximize shareholder value through management's team-oriented culture and prudent financial management.</p>
</text>
